From the unified log (subsystem dev.cdplayer.CDPlayer, category DiscRead): 22 "Concealed audio at CD LBA" lines, LBA 2180 to 2201 contiguous, all logged by this run at about the +7 s mark. No other run between 18:00 and 19:05 logged one.
  These sectors lie about 2 s into track 4, about 23 s ahead of the play position (LBA 464 at 6.19 s), so the audio of the window itself was unaffected. The tool still withholds the checksum when any sector of the final run was concealed.
  The same sectors were not flagged in the capture of track 4 (LBA 2025-2699; 0 C2-flagged sectors). The cause was not found; a marginal spot on the CD-RW or a transient read condition is possible. The run with the retry policy below found nothing to retry.

