$ log show --start "2026-11-03 20:00:00" --end "2026-11-03 20:35:00" --info --style compact --predicate '(process == "CDPlayer" AND eventMessage CONTAINS "trackMouse send action on mouseUp") OR (process == "diskarbitrationd" AND eventMessage CONTAINS "queued solicitation")' > /tmp/cdplayer-eject-cause.log 2>&1
The file has 39 lines: a header, 32 clicks (31 in PID 14932, the CD Player of these blocks, and one at 20:02:54 in PID 95854, an earlier instance) and the 6 solicitations. Each solicitation pair with the line before it (process name and PID kept, thread and subsystem removed):
